Hypothesis HKnil : K [].
Hypothesis Hfp : PML.fp_ok fx.
Hypothesis Hentry : PML.entry L R M sp r SCRC.
Hypothesis Ha0 : PML.a0 R P.
Hypothesis Ha1 : PML.a1 R E.
Hypothesis Hmore : PML.ps_more ps = true.
